## Interface: @WOWLAB_INTERFACE@
## Title: WowLab
## Notes: Records this character's gear, talents, appearance choices, collections, currencies, professions, spellbook, action bars, key bindings, macros, name, realm, guild, race, body type and class for the local wowlab tools, on this computer only; nothing is sent anywhere. Other players only if you turn the crew book on (/wowlab crew on).
## SavedVariables: WowLabDB, WowLabCrewDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: WowLabCharDB

# Template (ADR-0026): `wowlab addon install lab` replaces the Interface
# placeholder with the discovered client's interface version; the repository
# never holds a number (L6).

Core.lua
Gear.lua
Talents.lua
Customization.lua
Collections.lua
Currencies.lua
Professions.lua
Actions.lua
Identity.lua
Crew.lua
